@host = http://localhost:5062
@csrfToken = 請先執行 csrf-token，並貼上回傳的 token
@accessToken = 登入後取得的 Access Token

GET {{host}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{host}}/api/v1/security/csrf-token
Accept: application/json

###

POST {{host}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-TOKEN: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "account": "admin",
  "password": "請使用本機 Secret"
}

###

GET {{host}}/api/v1/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Accept: application/json

###
